        "text": "=Act as a Senior Solutions Architect. Write a 2-sentence outreach for {{ $json.first_name.split(' ')[0] }}.\n\nContext:\n- Company: {{ $json.company_name }}\n- Friction: {{ $json.challenges }}\n\nInstructions:\nSentence 1: Directly address the operational bottleneck or time-leak caused by {{ $json.challenges.split(',')[0] }} at {{ $json.company_name }}. Focus on the efficiency loss.\n\nSentence 2: Ask if they are open to a 30-second look at a logic map of how we automated this exact workflow recently.\n\nSTRICT RULES:\n1. MAX 25 words.\n2. NO \"I'm writing to\", \"I noticed\", or corporate jargon.\n3. Start with the problem. No fluff.\n4. Use \"sentence case\" (no unnecessary caps).\n5. NO salutations or signatures.",
